    "sections": {
        "description": "Material AI is FSE (Full Site Editing)theme. Its fully block/pattern based theme. It gives your real editing experience in WordPress. This theme can be use for multipurpose business website. No extra plugin with theme. Your site will run smoothly. Multiple style variation available for color switch. 11 pattern included in the free version. You can manage in the theme such as color, typography, spacing and styles. Material AI Pro version comes with many blocks and pattern by pages wise setup on our demo. Free Version: https://nayrathemes.com/demo/lite/materialai/ Pro Version: https://nayrathemes.com/demo/pro/materialai/"
